  "title": "Salmon Yakitori",
  "description": "This simple marinade of soy, sake, mirin and sugar gives salmon a lovely Asian-inspired taste while allowing the richness and flavor of the meat to shine through. This is great for an easy summer dinner, served with grilled or stir fried vegetables.",
